<section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">EMERALD / PACKAGE TOOLCHAIN</p>
    <h1>pkgbuild</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        Build a package from the current port recipe. This page documents the
        executable itself; port structure, recipe authoring, persistent build
        state, and package policy are documented separately in
        <a href="#/pm/ports">Creating ports</a>.
    </p>

    <div class="command-line"># pkgbuild [options] [port-directory]</div>
</section>

